     The sscchheedd__44bbssdd scheduler has been present, in various forms, since the
     inception of BSD.

BBUUGGSS
     While a highly robust and time-tested scheduler, sscchheedd__44bbssdd lacks spe‐
     cific knowledge of how to schedule advantageously in non-symmetric pro‐
     cessor configurations, such as hyper-threading.

